// Defender offboarding package downloaded
//
// Fires when someone downloads the Defender offboarding package. That package removes
// Defender from devices.
//
// Runs:      Continuous (NRT)
// Severity:  High
// MITRE:     T1562.001
// Tables:    CloudAppEvents
//
// Needs:
//   - The Defender for Cloud Apps Microsoft 365 connector with Microsoft 365 activities
//     turned on.
//
// Triage (paste into Recommended actions):
//   - Check who downloaded it, from which IP, and if a change ticket covers it.
//   - Confirm with the person out of band.
//   - Escalate as an incident if there's no ticket.
//
// Based on: Bert-Jan Pals' query, https://github.com/Bert-JanP/Hunting-Queries-Detection-Rules/blob/main/Defender%20XDR/OffboardingPackageDownloaded.md

CloudAppEvents
| where ingestion_time() > ago(1d)
| where ActionType == "DownloadOffboardingPkg"
| project Timestamp, ReportId, AccountObjectId, AccountDisplayName, IPAddress, ActionType
